{"id":"157aaa9ee5788515","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-circuit-eval.md","title":"电路求值语言","display":"df-circuit-eval — 电路求值语言","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-circuit-eval","aliases":["28-df-circuit-eval"],"display":"df-circuit-eval — 电路求值语言","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 6.30 (CIRCUIT-EVAL)","source_printed_pages":"119","source_pdf_pages":"145","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-circuit-eval"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-circuit-eval</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-circuit-eval — 电路求值语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 6.30 (CIRCUIT-EVAL)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"119"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"145"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}\">\\(\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{desc}\">\\(\\operatorname{desc}\\)</span> 为下式给出的编码限制。配对串采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle u,v\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(u,v)\">\\(\\langle u,v\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(u,v)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{desc}(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(C)\\qquad(C\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\ \\operatorname{BF}(C)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{desc}(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(C)\\qquad(C\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\ \\operatorname{BF}(C)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CIRCUIT\\_EVAL}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle\\operatorname{desc}(C),x\\rangle:n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\ \\operatorname{BF}(C),\\ x\\in\\Sigma^n,\\ \\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle1\\rangle\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CIRCUIT\\_EVAL}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle\\operatorname{desc}(C),x\\rangle:n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\ \\operatorname{BF}(C),\\ x\\in\\Sigma^n,\\ \\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle1\\rangle\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>实例同时包含电路及其输入赋值；这与“是否存在某赋值使电路输出1”的Circuit-SAT不同。无效描述或输入长度不符的串拒绝。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 6.30 (CIRCUIT-EVAL)；印刷 pp.119 / PDF pp.145。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n<p>R7复核：按 Theorem 6.30（PDF145）的标准电路输入表示补齐编码效率；本次核对定义陈述与表示条件，未将P完全性的原书证明升级为已完整复核。</p>\n<p>R7编码补核：P完全性对应df-p-complete中的对数空间多一归约，因此明确序列表编码的对数空间字段操作；这里顺序扫描既有顶点编号，没有把任意DAG求拓扑排序作为编码步骤。全目录未发现独立CIRCUIT-EVAL定理公式调用，本项对应源书Theorem6.30。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]。$\\operatorname{desc}$ 为下式给出的编码限制。配对串采用 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]] 的 $\\langle u,v\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(u,v)$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]。$\\operatorname{desc}$ 为下式给出的编码限制。配对串采用 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]] 的 $\\langle u,v\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(u,v)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{desc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle u,v\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(u,v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{desc}(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(C)\\qquad(C\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\ \\operatorname{BF}(C)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CIRCUIT\\_EVAL}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle\\operatorname{desc}(C),x\\rangle:n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\ \\operatorname{BF}(C),\\ x\\in\\Sigma^n,\\ \\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle1\\rangle\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2216,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-299","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-size-class]]、[[28-df-time-advice-class]]、[[28-thm-p-poly-advice]]、[[28-thm-p-uniform-characterization]]、[[28-thm-nonuniform-hierarchy]]、[[28-df-circuit-eval]]。"}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d","0dfeff4bd5d69b86"]}